# Optional local overrides for `npm run dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (never committed).
# FlareFleet needs no secrets: the first super admin is created through the
# in-app setup screen (/setup) on first start.
#
# wrangler.jsonc carries the values of the deployed app, so a local run would put
# the production host into QR codes and try to send real e-mail. These two lines
# keep development to itself:
#
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5173
# EMAIL_ENABLED=false
